          "articleText": "County Group’s, established in the year 2005, remarkable journey has been marked by planned and careful expansions, innovative and exceptional developments, and most importantly, a positive intention towards our customers. With this noteworthy journey and based on our ideology, our firm can be synonymous with excellence, innovation, and customer satisfaction. Trust and Loyalty are the foundations of any business. County Group truly understands this and has earned this valuable asset from our countless valuable clients and established its unique identity in the real estate market. This peculiarity is viable through County Group’s efficient team and their hard work who not only make our client's real estate journey seamless but also consult them in a positive direction. County Group’s inventories possess an impressive range of properties, ranging from refined to ultra-luxurious, and of course, all are designed to meet the evolving needs of modern living and working. People associated with us know very well that County Group never compromises with construction quality, and always builds a strong vibrant community, which is evident in every project. The outstanding feature of County Group’s innovative developments is their meticulous location selection. We very well know that home is not just a home, it is a place of warmth, love, and joy, an extension of your true self, that reflects your personality and personal wealth. Furthermore, County Group can surely state that the spaces apart from luxurious apartments, like clubhouses, sports arena, entertainment zones, and swimming pool areas, are stunning and are cardinal for all our projects, we always strike a balance between all these spaces, while designing a project. Awards: We're proud to have earned a reputation for excellence in the real estate industry, and our numerous awards and accolades are the indications of our team's hard work, expertise, and passion for delivering exceptional inventories. It has been an honor to be at the receiving end of the development, imparted through several prestigious institutions. We've been recognized for our outstanding inventories, innovative and unique landscape, and of course, our positive intention towards our customers. We, County Group, would wholeheartedly like to thank everyone, who is a part of us, for their unending support Our vision is to be the leading real estate firm in the global market, shape the future of real estate, and create a long-lasting impression on the communities we serve Furthermore, we aim to shape the future of real estate by welcoming technology, innovation, and social responsibility, to build a prosperous diverse community. The ideology on which the County Group works is - Building Trust, Creating Value, Exceeding Expectations, and most important, forming a Strong and Vibrant Community. Delivering inventories with excellence in the real estate market is the predominant mission of County Group. Furthermore, our mission is not only restricted to building homes and delivering them but also to work efficiently and make sure of a smooth process of all the services. Our core mission is to build a strong community and enhance the quality of life for our customers. Mr. Ramawtar Ramsisaria, with over 35 years of experience in the real estate industry, plays a pivotal role, in the company’s cardinal operations, like procurement, product selection, or marketing. Without his guidance, it wouldn’t be possible for us to become a prominent industry expert. He believes that Count Spaces are not just living spaces, but these are the indications of the firm’s commitment to creating vibrant communities, which provide comfort, convenience, energizing and a sense of belonging. Having the experience of 25 years in the real estate industry, and has a cardinal role in the development of numerous residential projects in NCR. His expertise and abundance of guidance aid us in accomplishing the firm’s goals, and of course, the desires of our wonderful loyal customers. His major quality is to build strong and healthy relationships with their teams, partners, and most importantly, their customers. He believes that a people-centric approach always works best in achieving any business dream. With over 20+ years of experience in real estate development and management, with a proven track record of successfully leading residential as well as commercial projects and driving business growth, Amit Modi continuously strives to build a vibrant community. Notable developments such as Orange County, Cherry County, Olive County, and many more, have bloomed in the real estate industry. His role as an innovative and visionary leader has a major contribution to the County Group’s Success. Corporate OfficeCounty SpacesPlot No. 15, Sector-135Noida-201305, U.P. info@countygroup.in +91-120-4022100 Policies Terms of Use Privacy Policy Disclaimer Blog Sitemap Disclaimer: The imagery presented is for representative purposes only and may not",
