e role of the promoter and the various group entities and persons through whom the funds were routed. ANI Published On Oct 3, 2026 at 08:12 AM IST See more on: Ozone Urbana Infra Developers, S Vasudevan, money laundering investigation, real estate fraud, Enforcement Directorate, Bengaluru Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights & analysis in your inbox. All about ETRealty industry right on your smartphone! Download the ETRealty App and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles. HomeNewsRegulatoryED arrests Ozone Urbana Infra Developer's CMD in ₹927.22 crore homebuyer alleged fraud case Regulatory 3 min read ED arrests Ozone Urbana Infra Developer's CMD in ₹927.22 crore homebuyer alleged fraud case Vasudevan was arrested on September 30 under Section 19 of the Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA), 2002, in connection with the money laundering investigation being conducted against Ozone Urbana Infra Developers Pvt Ltd and Others. Regulatory",
