        {
          "title": "Regent Hill B Wing",
          "description": "Regent Hill is designed for the aspirant generation who wants to be connected at all times and everywhere with 1 bhk aparmtments conveniently located in Hiranandani Gardens,...",
          "articleText": "REGENT HILL A,B,C,D,E Wing - MahaRERA Registration Number P51800018620 Regent Hill is crafted for the ambitious generation, who like to be connected at all times, all around. It is ideally located at Hiranandani Gardens, Powai a modern township with everything you could wish for-pristine nature, exquisite lifestyle amenities, modern day conveniences and exceptional connectivity. The aesthetically conceived Regent Hill is a manifestation of contemporary design and timeless neo-classical architecture that gives you a one of it's kind lifestyle experience. The cozy 1 BHK Apartments in Powai are tastefully designed to maximize usable space and give you comforts and conveniences that pamper and invigorate you. Regent Hill thus provides you a calm haven and a sense of community amidst the energy of a vibrant neighborhood. Hiranandani Group has always respected the ever evolving demands of it's customers and endeavoured to fulfill all their dreams and aspirations. We appreciate the urgency of reaching places and attaining goals faster that drives the Now Generation. Hence we have developed luxurious smartly designed 1 BHK Apartments/Flats in Powai for them at Hiranandani Gardens that is centrally located with business hubs, airports, metro rail, road connectivity to both Central and Western Suburbs all just a few minutes away. It's because we fully subscribe to the Now generations view that amidst all the buzz and rush of Mumbai city, ease of connectivity is the true luxury. And therefore there cannot be a better choice of elegant 1 BHK homes in Powai than Regent Hill at Hiranandani Gardens, Powai for the ambitious go-getters. It is surrounded by everything you could ask for – breathtaking views of lush mountains and shimmering lakes, exceptional all round connectivity, all modern day conveniences just round the corner and high-end lifestyle amenities. Crafted with your comfort in mind the 1 BHK Flats/Apartments at Powai in Regent Hill sets new standards in well-defined lifestyles with their elegance and sophistication. These thoughtfully crafted exquisite 1 BHK Homes perfectly complement your penchant for an extraordinary lifestyle with their refined aesthetics, cozy interiors and exceptional craftsmanship in every detail. These well-planned 1 BHK Flats / Apartments in Powai maximize usable space, while its top-of-the-line amenities provide you all the necessary comforts to indulge your ambitious dreams. The exquisite double height air-conditioned entrance lobby gives you a grand welcome, the gearless high speed lifts and well decorated floor lobbies are the perfect precursor to your posh 1 BHK abodes. REGENT HILL has exquisite 1 BHK Flats / Apartments with air-conditioned living, dining and bedroom. They have immaculate kitchen platform, modular kitchen cabinets and white goods like the hob & hood, refrigerator, washing machine cum dryer, microwave oven, designer bathrooms and high-quality branded fixtures. REGENT HILL with its multi-level security system with CCTV surveillance at building entrance lobby, the audio intercom using IP-EPABX (video call supported), comprehensive firefighting and fire alarm system, is the safest haven for your loved ones. REGENT HILL also provides power back-up for pump, lift, lobby and stairs area, LED lights in the common areas, mechanized car parking, FTTH ready low voltage structured cabling system inside apartment and common DTH dish antenna. REGENT HILL has every modern day convenience in its vicinity-from fine dine restaurants, top-grade schools like The Hiranandani Foundation School and HFS International School, high-end brands at the shopping arcades- Haiko Mall and Galleria, the best healthcare facilities at the Dr.L.H.Hiranandani Hospital, buzzing business complexes, the international and domestic airports as well as easy accessibility to both the western and central suburbs of Mumbai. In fact at Regent Hill, Hiranandani Gardens, Powai you will never be too far from the world. Click here to know more about the township. Regent Hill A, B, C, D and E Wing - The project has been registered via MahaRERA registration No.: P51800018620 and is available on the website https://maharera.mahaonline.gov.in under registered projects. Regent Hill A, B, C, D and E Wing are mortgaged with ICICI Bank Limited. The No Objection Certificate (NOC)/permission of the mortgagee Bank would be provided for sale of flats/units/property, if required. 1st Floor, Olympia, Central Avenue,Hiranandani Business ParkHiranandani Gardens, Powai, Mumbai - 400 076Email: info@hrealty.comTel: +91 22 6545 3705 Powai & PanvelEmail: presales@hiranandani.netTel: +91 7948501649 / +91 7948501685 ChennaiEmail: hparks@hrealty.comTel: +91 44 4627 3030 KhandalaEmail: alterra@hrealty.comTel: +91 22 4896 3366 19, 64, 682 Visits on website ABOUT PROJECTS TYPOLOGY QUICK LINKS OTHER WEBSITES",
