          "articleText": "Rera Number PRM/KA/RERA/1251/309/PR/040426/008572 https://rera.karnataka.gov.in/ Why to buy in this project? There comes a moment when success is no longer about proving anything. It becomes about recognising what you have built – the discipline, the ambition, the distance travelled. The next phase is not louder. It is more considered. More reflective of who you have become. TVS Emerald Altura is that natural evolution. A world shaped not around aspiration, but around self-worth. Where space feels intentional. Where calm feels earned. Where every detail acknowledges the life you have already built. Here, experience a lifestyle reserved for the select ones. At TVS Emerald Altura, you can choose 3 bed illustrious homes amidst lush greenery. With 35+ lifestyle amenities, you have unlimited avenues for leisure, every day. Get direction From Yelahanka, Bagalur Main Road, North Bangalore Master Plan 2-bhk-classic-1 2-bhk-classic-2 2-bhk-premium-1 2-bhk-premium-2 3-bhk-classic-1 3-bhk-classic-2 3-bhk-premium-1 3-bhk-premium-2 3-bhk-luxe-1 3-bhk-luxe-2 Tower-1 Tower-2 Tower-3 Tower-5 Tower-6 2-bhk-classic-2 TVS Emerald Altura is spread across 10.06 acres, offering the scale needed for a thoughtfully planned residential community with homes, open areas, and lifestyle spaces. TVS Emerald Altura’s apartments for sale in North Bengaluru offer 71% open space, creating a more open and breathable living environment. This generous layout supports greenery, movement, and a more relaxed residential experience. These apartments for sale in North Bengaluru has 12 towers with tower-wise unit counts ranging from 52 to 104 units per tower. TVS Altura is located at Yelahanka, Bagalur Main Road. It is positioned in North Bengaluru, offering a residential setting within a rapidly developing and accessible part of the city. TVS Emerald Altura offers 36 amenities, giving residents a wide mix of recreation, wellness, and community-focused spaces within the project. Yes, the project includes two clubhouses with a combined area of 29,053.62 sq. ft., along with a 670 sq. ft. co-working space for about 18 people. This adds both leisure and work-friendly convenience within the community. Yes, the project is RERA approved. Its RERA number is PRM/KA/RERA/1251/309/PR/040426/008572. Yes, TVS Altura has a clear title and is freehold. The landowner is Emerald Haven Properties Private Limited. TVS Emerald Altura is built with Mivan walls and a raft foundation, a combination that supports strong structural stability and more precise construction. For homebuyers, this means a more robust build quality and a thoughtfully engineered foundation for long-term peace of mind. TVS Emerald Altura follows National Building Code guidelines and includes basement sprinklers, 8 m fire tender access, two exit staircases in all towers, and fire hose cabinets on every floor. Together, these measures are designed to improve safety, support faster emergency response, and make the building more prepared for evacuation when needed. The 13-passenger service lift is stretcher-friendly, which makes it useful for emergency movement and adds convenience in situations where extra assistance is needed. Yes, EV charging points are provided for 30% of parking slots, which makes the project more convenient for residents with electric vehicles. RERA Number: TN/01/Building/0194/2021 RERA Number: TN/29/Layout/0127/2019 TVS Emerald Altura, SH 104, Srinivasa Nagar, Yelahanka, Bagalur Main Road, North Bangalore 562149 +91 63850 61106 Senior Living Series · Part 5 of 5 Part 5 of our Senior Living series. Behind every senior living decision is one question that matters more than all the others. You can compare apartments, amenities, and price lists all day. But when a family chooses a senior living community, the decision really comes down to a single, […] Senior Living Series · Part 4 of 5 Part 4 of our Senior Living series. Strip away the jargon and the fear, and a senior living