          "articleText": "Rera Number PRM/KA/RERA/1251/472/PR/110925/008087 https://rera.karnataka.gov.in/ Homes built on principles. Spaces filled with purpose At TVS Emerald Auralis, life flows in balance between architecture and intention. Spread across 3.71 acres in the high-potential corridor of Thanisandra, this community offers 2 & 3 BHK vaastu-compliant homes built to harmonise with your lifestyle. Every element, from the layout to the light, echoes purposeful design that balances energy flow. Located next to prominent IT parks, schools, hospitals, and the International Airport, Auralis ties work, life, and leisure together in a neat package. And with premium amenities . Get direction From Thanisandra, Bangalore Master Plan 3bhk-2t-2 3bhk-2t-15 3bhk-2t-16 3bhk-2t-17 3bhk-2t-18 3bhk-2t-19 3bhk-2t-20 3bhk-2t-21 3bhk-2t-22 3bhk-2t-23 3bhk-2t-24 3bhk-3t-26 3bhk-3t-27 3bhk-3t-28 3bhk-3t-29 3bhk-3t-30 3bhk-3t-31 TVS Emerald Auralis is spread across 3.71 acres, offering residents a thoughtfully planned space that offers urban living and serenity under one roof. The development includes six residential towers, meticulously designed to deliver privacy and comfort. All apartments at TVS Emerald Auralis are Vaastu compliant. Residents at TVS Emerald Auralis are surrounded by premier shopping and entertainment options, including Bharatiya Mall (4.9 km), Galleria Mall (6.4 km), Elements Mall (8.3 km), and Phoenix Marketcity (9.7 km), all within easy reach for leisure and daily convenience. *(Distances mentioned are as per Google Maps) Quality healthcare is just minutes away from the project, with hospitals like REGAL Hospital (3.9 km), Cytecare Hospitals (5.1 km), Sparsh Hospital (6.1 km), and Manipal Hospital Hebbal (11.4 km) nearby, ensuring the well-being of the residents. TVS Emerald Auralis is located 18.4 km from Kempegowda International Airport. Major railway stations like K R Puram (17.7 km, 35 mins) and Bangalore Cantonment (18.9 km, 28 mins) offer excellent connectivity from the project for frequent travellers. Additionally, the upcoming Bagalur Cross Metro Station will add to the ease of travel for residents at Auralis. Families benefit from proximity to notable schools, including Delhi Public School (2.5 km), EuroSchool North Campus (3.1 km), Canadian International School (6.3 km), and Chrysalis High School (7.4 km) from Auralis. Top educational institutions such as REVA University (210 m), Nalapad Group of Institutions (1.7 km), Karnataka College of Management (3.6 km), CMR University (3.7 km), and Ebenezer Group of Institutions (7.3 km) are conveniently close to the project. TVS Emerald Auralis features thoughtfully designed 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments tailored for families of every size and lifestyle. Residents have access to over 15 high-end amenities, including a large swimming pool with a dedicated kids’ pool, fitness centre, squash court, lush gardens, jogging track, games room, mini-theatre, co-working lounge, and banquet hall at TVS Emerald Auralis. Yes, residents can benefit from a co-working area, which is ideal for remote work, collaboration, or quiet study, enriching your modern lifestyle Yes. TVS Emerald Auralis is RERA-compliant, registered under PRMKARERA1251472PR110925008087, guaranteeing transparency and full regulatory conformity in every aspect of the development. RERA Number: TN/01/Building/0194/2021 RERA Number: TN/29/Layout/0127/2019 TVS Emerald Thanisandra, Bengaluru, 560064 +91 80692 36661 Senior Living Series · Part 5 of 5 Part 5 of our Senior Living series. Behind every senior living decision is one question that matters more than all the others. You can compare apartments, amenities, and price lists all day. But when a family chooses a senior living community, the decision really comes down to a single, […] Senior Living Series · Part 4 of 5 Part 4 of our Senior Living series. Strip away the jargon and the fear, and a senior living home is something you already understand completely. A lot of 