          "title": "NHB RESIDEX (with Base Year FY 2017-18)",
          "description": "NHB RESIDEX (with Base Year FY 2017-18)",
          "articleText": "Linking Factor Reasons for shifting base year from FY 2012-13 to FY 2017-18 In the pilot phase for NHB RESIDEX, 2001 was chosen as the base year in order to make it comparable with WPI and CPI. Thereafter, the base year was shifted to 2007 and then to FY 2012-13. In order to make NHB RESIDEX relevant to the market scenario it is proposed that there will be automatic shifting of base year every five years. The Government of India has initiated steps to revise the base years of Gross Domestic Product (GDP) and Index of Industrial Production (IIP) to FY 2017-18 and for Consumer Price Index (CPI) to 2018. Therefore, it has been considered to further shift the base year for NHB RESIDEX from FY 2012-13 to FY 2017-18. Linking of Price Indices Linking factors are the conversion coefficients (multipliers) linking two or more indices prepared on shifting the base year. Since the base year for the NHB RESIDEX has been shifted from FY 2012-13 to FY 2017-18, presented below are linking factor conversion (forward linking and backward linking) for the indices built on FY 2012-13 as the base year and FY 2017-18 as the base year. Ratio Method is used to calculate Linking Factor Table: Forward Linking Factor and Backward Linking Factor for 50 cities City Name HPI@Assessment Price HPI@Market Price (Under Construction) Forward Linking Factor Backward Linking Factor Forward Linking Factor Backward Linking Factor Ahmedabad 1.07 0.94 1.39 0.72 Bengaluru 1.36 0.74 1.35 0.74 Bhiwadi 1.13 0.89 1.23 0.81 Bhopal 1.11 0.90 1.13 0.88 Bhubaneswar 1.21 0.82 1.35 0.74 Bidhan Nagar (Excluding Rajarhat) 1.43 0.70 1.58 0.63 Chakan 1.49 0.67 1.36 0.73 Chandigarh (Tricity) 0.99 1.01 1.17 0.86 Chennai 1.28 0.78 1.36 0.73 Coimbatore 1.16 0.86 1.33 0.75 Dehradun 1.09 0.92 1.56 0.64 Delhi 1.01 0.99 0.94 1.06 Faridabad 1.07 0.93 1.12 0.90 Gandhinagar 1.03 0.97 1.16 0.86 Ghaziabad 1.10 0.91 1.21 0.83 Greater Noida 1.23 0.81 1.10 0.91 Gurugram 1.14 0.87 1.12 0.90 Guwahati 1.28 0.78 1.