ions at Sikanderpur and prepare a detailed project report on the appropriate grade-separated solution. At IFFCO Chowk, GMDA will coordinate with the National Highways Authority of India (NHAI) to prepare a redevelopment plan covering vehicular movement, pedestrian safety and existing utilities.Read more 4 hours ago Adambakkam MRTS station in Chennai has remained non-operational for more than seven months after the 4.5-km Velachery–St Thomas Mount extension was inaugurated on March 14, with trains continuing to pass through the station without a passenger halt. The extension connected St Thomas Mount with the existing MRTS network and full-scale suburban services began between St Thomas Mount and Chennai Beach. While trains stop at Puzhuthivakkam, Adambakkam has not received clearance for passenger operations because of a safety issue involving the alignment of the platform on a curved section of track. The issue was identified during an inspection by the Chief Commissioner of Railway Safety in March, preventing the station from being opened despite the extension itself being operational.Read more 5 hours ago India currently has 66 airports under development as the government seeks to expand regional and international air connectivity, Union Civil Aviation Minister Shri Kinjarapu Rammohan Naidu said. The minister made the remarks during the curtain raiser for Routes Asia 2027, which will be held at Bharat Mandapam in New Delhi from March 16 to 18. More than 115 airlines and representatives from over 55 countries are expected to participate. The government is using the event to engage airlines and aviation stakeholders on new routes, while the broader airport expansion programme is intended to connect more cities and support tourism, trade and economic activity.Read more Advertisement The Gulf conflict has disrupted global supply chains, pushed... REITs have changed the way commercial real estate is owned a... What really powers the cloud? Behind every Google search, 