ombo representatives presented the project’s proposition for India, while CREDAI Chennai members had the opportunity to seek information directly and assess potential business interests independently.Read more 9 hours ago Oriom Group has entered Odisha’s real estate sector with the launch of Oriom Realty, a dedicated vertical that will develop residential, retail, commercial, hospitality and mixed-use projects across the state. The group, which originated in Jharsuguda and is headquartered in Bhubaneswar, plans to initially focus on Bhubaneswar and other emerging growth corridors. The move follows 21 years of operations across steel and power, speciality chemicals and refractories. Oriom Group has more than 3,000 employees and operates industrial facilities across eastern India. The company said its real estate strategy is being driven by Odisha’s infrastructure investments, industrial expansion, urbanisation and rising incomes. It also plans to leverage its engineering, project execution and governance capabilities to develop planned communities and commercial assets.Read more 12 hours ago VTP Realty’s residential projects VTP Aethereus and VTP Sierra in Pune have received the Smart Fire & Security Award in the Residential category at the FIST Awards 2026. The recognition was presented on 3 September 2026 at the Jio World Convention Centre in Mumbai during the 10th edition of the Fire & Integrated Security Technology Awards. The award acknowledged the projects’ adoption of smart fire and security systems as part of their residential planning and execution. Organised by the Fire & Security Association of India in association with NOVA Exhibitions & Conferences, the annual awards cover fire safety, security, firefighting, emergency response and technology-led innovations across sectors. The 2026 edition featured 22 categories covering residential and commercial developments, industrial infrastructure, luxury hotels and resorts, hospitals and other projects.Read more 