areer spanning over 33 years in Project and Construction Management. His expertise encompasses Project Execution, Stakeholder Engagement, Risk Mitigation, Value Engineering, and Team Leadership. Over the years, he has held pivotal roles such as Project Director at Convergence Property Development Services, Vice President (Projects) at Indroyal Properties, and senior leadership positions at Colliers International and Synergy Property Development Services. Known for his ability to drive excellence and deliver exceptional results, he is passionate about mentoring future leaders and fostering innovation in the construction and real estate sectors.",
